-downward\">20-cor-hif-downward</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d18ba716e49ac8c6\" href=\"?note=d18ba716e49ac8c6\" title=\"20-thm-K-undecidable\">20-thm-K-undecidable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e890b3c29e4a70a3\" href=\"?note=e890b3c29e4a70a3\" title=\"20-df-jump\">20-df-jump</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing&lt;_T A\">\\(\\varnothing&lt;_T A\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HIF}(\\deg_T(A))\">\\(\\operatorname{HIF}(\\deg_T(A))\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5110e3608f32da9d\" href=\"?note=5110e3608f32da9d\" title=\"20-thm-delta2-hyperimmune\">20-thm-delta2-hyperimmune</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c82e036702142487\" href=\"?note=c82e036702142487\" title=\"20-cor-hif-downward\">20-cor-hif-downward</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d18ba716e49ac8c6\" href=\"?note=d18ba716e49ac8c6\" title=\"20-thm-K-undecidable\">20-thm-K-undecidable</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e890b3c29e4a70a3\" href=\"?note=e890b3c29e4a70a3\" title=\"20-df-jump\">20-df-jump</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}nonzero-hif-incomparable}\\vdash\nA\\not\\le_T\\varnothing\\prime\\quad\\land\\quad\\varnothing\\prime\\not\\le_T A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}nonzero-hif-incomparable}\\vdash\nA\\not\\le_T\\varnothing\\prime\\quad\\land\\quad\\varnothing\\prime\\not\\le_T A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\le_T0\\prime\">\\(A\\le_T0\\prime\\)</span>，非零 Δ₂ 度定理矛盾；若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\prime\\le_T A\">\\(0\\prime\\le_T A\\)</span>，HIF 向下封闭会使非零的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\prime\">\\(0\\prime\\)</span> HIF，同样矛盾。</p>\n<p>来源：Corollary 5.6.8；印刷页 126；PDF 第 161 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-thm-delta2-hyperimmune","status":"resolved","id":"5110e3608f32da9d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-delta2-hyperimmune]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-cor-hif-downward","status":"resolved","id":"c82e036702142487","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-cor-hif-downward]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-K-undecidable","status":"resolved","id":"d18ba716e49ac8c6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-K-undecidable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"e890b3c29e4a70a3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-delta2-hyperimmune","status":"resolved","id":"5110e3608f32da9d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-delta2-hyperimmune]]；see [[20-cor-hif-downward]]；see [[20-thm-K-undecidable]]；see [[20-df-jump]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-cor-hif-downward","status":"resolved","id":"c82e036702142487","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-delta2-hyperimmune]]；see [[20-cor-hif-downward]]；see [[20-thm-K-undecidable]]；see [[20-df-jump]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-K-undecidable","status":"resolved","id":"d18ba716e49ac8c6","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-delta2-hyperimmune]]；see [[20-cor